          "returnType": null,
          "description": "When the sequence's clock runs, relative to the scene's pause flag. A sequence advances only on ticks of that clock, so this also decides when waits complete. Defaults to SceneAvailability.Active: a paused scene freezes its sequences. A retained scene's sequences are frozen whatever the policy, and resume where they were on restore."
